# ── Ignore everything by default ──────────────────────────────────────
/*

# ── ...then allow back only our own work ──────────────────────────────
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
# notes/ stays local on purpose -- working notes, not published
!patches/

# mods: only the ones we wrote or changed
!mods/
mods/*
!mods/tournament/
!mods/title/
mods/title/*
!mods/title/src/

# Uncomment once you've replaced upstream's README.md with your own.
# GitHub only renders the one at the repo root.
#!README.md

# ── Never, under any circumstances ────────────────────────────────────
*.iso
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store